  Mode: 126
  IsMultiplayer: 1
  DisplayName: Marionette
  Description: 'Jewel Wasps only - a duel in the kelp. Sting a creature with a pull of RT and ride it:
    point it at a rival pilot and RT plays its attack, and every attack that lands is a
    point. Charge makes the attack ready sooner, and at Charge 5 leaving a creature bursts
    it on every rival near it. An omni crystal hatches a predator you ride at once. Higher
    intensities grow more kelp and thin the herds. First team to the target wins.'
